          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Turning The Tie-Dyed",
            "description": "Tie-dye has made a significant comeback in recent years, evolving from a 60s counterculture symbol to a mainstream fashion staple. From high-end runways to everyday streetwear, tie-dye patterns are everywhere. The versatility and individuality of each piece make tie-dye a favorite among fashion enthusiasts of all ages. This resurgence presents a golden opportunity for retailers to capitalize on the trend by offering unique and vibrant tie-dye products.",
