            "link_url": "",
            "column_background": true,
            "column_background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "column_text_color": "#000000",
            "column_link_color": "#2877ff"
          }
        },
        "column_p8bHbX": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits of Stocking Tie-Dye Products",
            "description": "Unique Appeal: No two tie-dye items are exactly alike, giving each piece a unique appeal that attracts customers looking for individuality in their wardrobe.\n\nBroad Demographic: Tie-dye appeals to a wide range of customers, from young trendsetters to nostalgic adults who appreciate the vintage vibe.\n\nVersatile Offerings: From t-shirts and hoodies to accessories and home decor, tie-dye products span various categories, allowing retailers to diversify their inventory.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "column_background": true,
            "column_background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "column_text_color": "#000000",
            "column_link_color": "#2877ff"
          }
        },
        "column_RFGThi": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Choose Free Spirited for Your Tie-Dye Wholesale Needs?",
            "description": "At Free Spirited, we specialize in creating high-quality, handcrafted tie-dye apparel that resonates with today’s fashion trends. Here’s why partnering with us can boost your retail business:\n\nPremium Quality: Our tie-dye products are made from high-quality materials, ensuring durability and vibrant colors that last.\n\nUnique Designs: We offer a wide range of patterns and color combinations, allowing you to provide your customers with a diverse selection.\n\nCompetitive Pricing: Our wholesale pricing is designed to offer retailers excellent margins without compromising on quality.\n\nSustainable Practices: We are committed to environmentally friendly practices, using non-toxic dyes and sustainable production methods.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "column_background": true,
            "column_background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "column_text_color": "#000000",
            "column_link_color": "#2877ff"
          }
        },
        "column_PCYw3y": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Get Started with Tie-Dye Wholesale",
            "description": "Explore Our Catalog: Visit our store to view our extensive catalog of tie-dye products.\n\nCreate an Account: Register for a wholesale account to access exclusive pricing and order management tools.\n\nPlace Your Order: Choose from our variety of products and place your order online. Our team is here to assist with any questions or custom requests.\n\nPromote Your New Inventory: Utilize our marketing materials and social media content to promote your new tie-dye products to your customers.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "column_background": true,
            "column_background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "column_text_color": "#000000",
            "column_link_color": "#2877ff"
          }
        },
        "column_iBkJTQ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Success Stories from Our Retail Partners",
            "description": "Many retailers have found success by adding Free Spirited tie-dye products to their stores. For example, Smiles Outlet, a boutique retailer in Delray Beach, Florida saw a 30% increase in sales after introducing our tie-dye apparel. Their customers love the unique designs and high-quality materials, making them a repeat buyer.",
